          <h3>Point of Sale</h3>
          <p class="rp-feat__why">Generate more revenue and provide a great checkout experience.</p>
          <p>Sell repair services, accessories, and gadgets from one screen. Add cart items, apply discounts, process card or cash payments, print or email receipts, and manage the entire checkout in seconds.</p>
          <ul class="rp-feat__list">
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Card, cash, and digital wallet payments</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Integrated terminal support (Dejavoo, etc.)</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Dual pricing / cash discount mode</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Inline discounts per item or cart-wide</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Instant receipt via print, email, or SMS</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="rp-feat" data-anim>
          <div class="rp-feat__icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-boxes-stacked"></i></div>
          <h3>Inventory Management</h3>
          <p class="rp-feat__why">Know exactly what you have, where it is, and when to reorder.</p>
          <p>Track standard and serialized parts across multiple locations, manage vendors, create purchase orders, get automatic low-stock alerts, and transfer inventory between stores with full audit trails.</p>
          <ul class="rp-feat__list">
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Serialized unit tracking (IMEI, serial #)</li>
            <li><i class="fa-solid fa-check"></i> Multi-location inventory transfers</li>
